/-!
# A claim-bound certificate for the full published BP equation

The four interior 3-spin parameters are (sigma,a) = (111,000), (11,100),
(1,110), (empty,111). Sixteen further rows are the explicit separating
images in `BelorousskiPandharipandeSources`. All twenty rows are summed
over S3, retaining six assignments even when some graphs coincide.
The exact witness derives the entire equation (4) of arXiv:math/9803072;
no lower-genus or lower-degree remainder is discarded.

Incoming graphs, source graphs, original rows, kappa conversion, marking
operations, stack normalizations and the published request are independently
held. Kernel replay certifies those finite computations. The final theorem
uses original generator vanishings and primitive graph-map compatibility;
it does not assume the BP equation or a surface recurrence.
-/

